            "title": "財律指揮｜港股仍在尋底 高派息防守為先 建行較穩陣｜曲鳴",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3173abcf6075a13e06dbea08cacf08cb9271bd52135a0550c38b1fb964a96291/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fbossmind_356%2F8e282788ddcc92d7cdd87f89541f0f18.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">港股近兩周跌勢加快，恒指失守23000點，上周五收約22400點，科網業績亦救不了大市。這個位置再去博反彈，容易接火棒；要留在場內，先要找防守力較強的股份。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">不過，不是所有股份都跟隨大市急挫。建行近月幾乎走平，大市由11月初高位回落接近一成之際，股價仍守在10.5元附近，抗跌力明顯。高派息是原因之一：中期息每股人民幣0.201元，派息率由30%提升至31%，下月3日除淨，即使大市再調整，息收仍在，較博一輪反彈來得實際。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-ce673040-f6c0-3080-9db2-d7f8c7aa6b23-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">公司質地亦撐得住。第三季股東應佔溢利按年升近10%，淨利息收益率企穩於1.36厘，不良貸款率1.29%，較去年底再低。不是純靠炒預期，是有盈利、有息收的內銀龍頭，加上政府亦需要內銀回饋資金，派息未來料不會降低。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">中國已經陸續著手救市，如果國家隊入市，估計也會優先入穩陣的指數ETF〝，而在ETF成份股中，有國家背景的內銀股，佔比較高，自然是較佳選擇。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">建行現價約10.48元，仍企穩20天線約10.4元之上。可於現水平約10.5元買入，目標先看11.3元，失守10元止蝕。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B2%A1%E5%BE%8B%E6%8C%87%E6%8F%AE-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%B0%8B%E5%BA%95-%E9%AB%98%E6%B4%BE%E6%81%AF%E9%98%B2%E5%AE%88%E7%82%BA%E5%85%88-%E5%BB%BA%E8%A1%8C%E8%BC%83%E7%A9%A9%E9%99%A3-%E6%9B%B2%E9%B3%B4-020000139.html",
